# zoom-wheel-3 (h2-input): three notches at (1078, 380), off-centre.
# From scale 0.5 the target is 0.5*e^0.3; the plane point under the cursor
# stays through the zoom (behaviour: reference label frames vs the port's
# shots/views). Settles to url scale=0.675 with the center moved toward the
# cursor.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 1078 380
wheel 0 100
wheel 0 100
wheel 0 100
wait 1500
shot zoom-wheel-3
